## Design Overview

**Core Data Structures:**
```cpp
struct Entry {
    std::atomic<Key> key;
    std::atomic<Value*> value;  
    std::atomic<uint32_t> state;  // EMPTY=0, OCCUPIED=1, DELETED=2
};

